{"strongs": "H5401", "word": "נָשַׁק", "translit": "na.shaq", "root": "נשר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "kiss", "definition": "I. נָשַׁק verb kiss (Late Hebrew id. , Assyrian našâku , ᵑ7 נְשֵׁיק , נְשַׁק , Syriac , kiss (originally smell [ ] according to Lag Nov.Psalt.Spec.24f. ): Arabic is fasten together, arrange in order , Ethiopic participle ordine dispositus, apte sertus Di 641, pos. akin to II. נשׁק ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ נ 1Kgs 19:18 ; 2Sam 15:5 3 feminine singular נָָֽשְׁקָה Prov 7:13 3 plural נָשָׁ֑קוּ Ps 85:11 Imperfect יִּשַּׁק Gen 41:40 , וַיִּשַּׁק Gen 27:27 +; suffix יִשָּׁקֵ֫נִי Song 1:2 1 singular cohortative אֶשֳּׁקָהֿ 1Kgs 19:20 3 masculine plural יִשָּׁק֑וּן Hos 13:2 , etc.; Imperative וּשֲׁקָה Gen 27:26 Infinitive construct נְשָׁקֿ 2Sam 20:9 — kiss , usually with לְ person: Gen 27:26 ; Gen 27:29 ; Gen 50:1 ; Exod 4:27 (all J ), Gen 48:10 ; Exod 18:7 (both E ), 2Sam 15:5 ; 2Sam 14:33 ; 2Sam 19:40 ; 2Sam 20:9 ; 2Sam 1:20 ; so of idol-worship 1Kgs 19:18 (compare We Skizzen iii. 105 ; Heid. 109), compare וַתִּשַּׁק יָדִי לְפִי Job 31:27 and my hand hath kissed my mouth ; rarely with accusative of person 1Sam 20:41 ( אִישׁ אֶתרֵֿעֵהוּ ), suffix person 1Sam 10:1 Canticles (+ מִגְּשִׁיקוֺת ), Song 8:1 also Gen 33:4 וַֹיִֹּשָֹּׁקֵֹהֹוֹּ ( J ; Holz E ; word suspicious, Di rejects); ׳ עֲגָלִים יִשּׁ Hos 13:2 claves do they kiss ; שְׁפָתַיִם יִשָּׁ֑ק Prov 24:26 lips he kisses ; absolute Ps 85:11 (figurative, reciprocal) . — עַלפִּֿיךָ יִשַּׁק Gen 41:40 is dubious, Di . 'to thy mouth all my people shall yield' (fit, adapt themselves, compare Arabic √), so Kau Buhl Lex , but this meaning uncertain, and text perhaps corrupt, see Di Holz ). Pi`el Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיְנַשֵּׁק Gen 32:1 ; Gen 45:15 , וַיְנַשֶּׁקֿ Gen 29:13 Imperative masculine plural נַשְּׁקוּֿ Ps 2:12 Infinitive construct נַשֵּׁק Gen 31:28 — kiss = Qal : with לְ person Gen 29:13 ( J ), Gen 31:28 ; Gen 32:1 ; Gen 45:15 (all E ); נַשְּׁקובַֿר Ps 2:12 is dubious, compare I. בַּר a above Hiph`il Participle מַשִּׁיקוֺתּ Ezek 3:13 of wings of cherubim, gently touching each other (with אֶלֿ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5427')\">BDB5427</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5401')\">H5401</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5426')\">BDB5426</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5428')\">BDB5428</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>נָשַׁק</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>kiss</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>našâku</highlight></transliteration>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>נְשֵׁיק</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נְשַׁק</bdbheb>, Syriac <placeholder3477/>, <highlight>kiss</highlight> (originally <highlight>smell</highlight> [<placeholder3478/>] according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>Nov.Psalt.Spec.24f.</sup></lookup>): Arabic <placeholder3479/> is <highlight>fasten together, arrange in order</highlight>, Ethiopic <placeholder3480/> participle <highlight>ordine dispositus, apte sertus</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>641, pos. akin to II.</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>נשׁק</bdbheb>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,18)\">1Kgs 19:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,5)\">2Sam 15:5</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>נָָֽשְׁקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 7:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,13)\">Prov 7:13</ref> 3 plural <bdbheb>נָשָׁ֑קוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 85:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,11)\">Ps 85:11</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִּשַּׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,40)\">Gen 41:40</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּשַּׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,27)\">Gen 27:27</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>יִשָּׁקֵ֫נִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 1:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,1,2)\">Song 1:2</ref> 1 singular cohortative <bdbheb>אֶשֳּׁקָהֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,20)\">1Kgs 19:20</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יִשָּׁק֑וּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,2)\">Hos 13:2</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>וּשֲׁקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,26)\">Gen 27:26</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>נְשָׁקֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,9)\">2Sam 20:9</ref> — <highlight>kiss</highlight>, usually with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> person: <ref ref=\"Gen 27:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,26)\">Gen 27:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 27:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,29)\">Gen 27:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,1)\">Gen 50:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 4:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,27)\">Exod 4:27</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 48:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,48,10)\">Gen 48:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 18:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,7)\">Exod 18:7</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,5)\">2Sam 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:33\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,33)\">2Sam 14:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:40\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,40)\">2Sam 19:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,9)\">2Sam 20:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,20)\">2Sam 1:20</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> so of idol-worship <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,18)\">1Kgs 19:18</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We<sup>Skizzen iii. 105</sup></lookup>; Heid. 109), compare <bdbheb>וַתִּשַּׁק יָדִי לְפִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,27)\">Job 31:27</ref> <highlight>and my hand hath kissed my mouth</highlight>; rarely with accusative of person <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:41\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,41)\">1Sam 20:41</ref> (<bdbheb>אִישׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֶתרֵֿעֵהוּ</bdbheb>), suffix person <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,1)\">1Sam 10:1</ref> Canticles (+ <bdbheb>מִגְּשִׁיקוֺת</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Song 8:1\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,1)\">Song 8:1</ref> also <ref ref=\"Gen 33:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,4)\">Gen 33:4</ref> <bdbheb>וַֹיִֹּשָֹּׁקֵֹהֹוֹּ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Holz')\">Holz</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; word suspicious, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> rejects); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֲגָלִים יִשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,2)\">Hos 13:2</ref> <highlight>claves do they kiss</highlight>; <bdbheb>שְׁפָתַיִם יִשָּׁ֑ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 24:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,26)\">Prov 24:26</ref> <highlight>lips he kisses</highlight>; absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 85:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,11)\">Ps 85:11</ref> (figurative, reciprocal) . — <bdbheb>עַלפִּֿיךָ יִשַּׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,40)\">Gen 41:40</ref> is dubious, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>. 'to thy mouth all my people shall yield' (fit, adapt themselves, compare Arabic √), so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Lex</sup></lookup>, but this meaning uncertain, and text perhaps corrupt, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Holz')\">Holz</lookup>). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיְנַשֵּׁק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,1)\">Gen 32:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 45:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,15)\">Gen 45:15</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיְנַשֶּׁקֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 29:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,13)\">Gen 29:13</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbheb>נַשְּׁקוּֿ</bdbheb> <ref re